3:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-fg transition-colors","children":"Back to Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent","children":"Industry Specific · Ecommerce"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Fix Ecommerce Landing Pages to Stop Burning Paid Ad Spend"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Low conversion on a product page is almost always one of five structural problems - not the product, not the price, and not the ad targeting. Diagnosing which leak is active tells you exactly where to spend the next hour. Running more ad budget before the diagnosis gives you more traffic at the same broken rate."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-ecommerce-landing-page-not-converting&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"How the ecommerce conversion sequence works - and where it breaks"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Every product page visit passes through the same sequence before it either converts or exits. The sequence is: arrive → read → trust → decide → add-to-cart → checkout. Each stage gates the next. A visitor who does not trust the page does not decide. A visitor who decides but cannot find the CTA does not add to cart. A visitor who abandons during checkout never purchased - but the page already lost them earlier."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The diagnostic question is: at which stage are you losing them? Analytics can answer this:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3","children":[["$","li","High bounce rate (under 15 seconds on page)",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border p-4","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg text-sm","children":"High bounce rate (under 15 seconds on page)"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-0.5","children":"Arrive → Read failure"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted mt-1","children":"Page does not match the ad, images are slow to load, or the product is immediately wrong for the visitor"}]]}],["$","li","Low add-to-cart rate (under 3% of sessions)",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border p-4","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg text-sm","children":"Low add-to-cart rate (under 3% of sessions)"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-0.5","children":"Trust → Decide failure"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted mt-1","children":"No social proof visible, unclear value proposition, or pricing perceived as too high without justification"}]]}],"$L11","$L12"]}]]}],"$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18"]}]}]
